 * Node order is users first, then movies (ungrouped `nUsers` / `nMovies`).
 *
 * @param {number[][]} R `R[u][i]` 0/1, shape `[nUsers][nMovies]`.
 * @returns {Object} A `Graph`-shaped object sufficient for `rowNormalize`.
