// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Reference graph (provided, read-only by convention)
//
// Exactly the readme.md section 4.1 fixture: node order A, B, C, D; directed
// edges A -> B, A -> C, B -> C, C -> A, D -> C; no dangling nodes. The two
