Now, should the alpha sweep still "drop" ppr vectors after scoring (hw6DropPprAlpha)? That's to bound memory during the sweep. But if we dropped them, a repeat full run's test PPR (at selected alpha) would need recompute. However the sweep drops the VALIDATION PPR vectors at the swept alpha. Then the comparison uses the same alpha for TEST cohort (different users), so those weren't cached anyway. But the drop removes val vectors. Fine.

