  * the score of `graph.movieIds[k]`, i.e. a movie-node-relative index, NOT a
  * global node index. Prefers graph.js's `movieIndexOf`; otherwise the position
  * inside `graph.movieIds`.
  *
  * @param {Object} graph
  * @returns {Map<number, number>}
